WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 3: Picture Time

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Every picture has a secret story waiting for your eyes! Look at the big neem tree standing proud under the blue sky.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Down at the bottom, cool blue water ripples. Look! A little white duck is paddling smoothly across the pond: splash, splash!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>Beside the pond, a pink flower blooms. A tiny yellow butterfly flutters its wings and rests gently on the petal. Can you spot it?

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>When you look at a picture, ask: What colours do I see? Who is at the top? Who is at the bottom? You are a brilliant observer!

